  "markdown": "[Skip to main content](https://avispl.com/services/support-and-maintenance/#main-content)\n\n# Support&  Maintenance\n\nAV/UC technology support options, including 24/7 help desk and field dispatch.\n\nScroll to bottom of the hero section\n\n![24/7 help desk technician on a customer support call](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Shot46-scaled.jpg)\n\n### Our certified experts support your technology\n\nOur extensive global network provides unmatched **service anytime, anywhere**. With distributed technicians around the world, we understand local intricacies and methods.\n\n[Contact Us](https://avispl.com/services/support-and-maintenance/#contact)\n\n## Supportoptions\n\nAVI-SPL offers both on-site resources and remote technical support services. Service level agreements are available in several tiers, with various add-on “plus” options to tailor to your needs. Support options include:\n\n- Manufacturer warranty support\n\n- Unlimited 24/7 help desk, available every day\n\n- Local repair and service dispatch\n\n- Preventative maintenance contracts\n\n\n## Choose your    support level\n\n### Enhanced   support\n\nOur Enhanced services give you an extra level of remote responsiveness and support with:\n\n- Unlimited remote help desk support – available globally 24/7 every day\n- Facilitation of manufacturer warranty repair or replacement programs\n- Remote software and firmware updates for covered assets\n\n[Contact Us](https://avispl.com/services/support-and-maintenance/#contact)\n\n### Elite   support\n\nOur Elite services give you an extra level of onsite responsiveness and support with:\n\n- Unlimited onsite support M-F, 8:00 a.m.-5:00 p.m. local time\n- 24/7 unlimited global remote help desk support\n- Facilitation of manufacturer warranty repair or replacement programs\n- Remote software and firmware updates for covered assets\n\n[Contact Us](https://avispl.com/services/support-and-maintenance/#contact)\n\n### Enterprise maintenance\n\nEnterprise Maintenance is a subscription service that provides 24/7 technical support for audio-visual and unified collaboration spaces that simplifies management, reduces cost of ownership, and delivers world-class support. It includes:\n\n- 24/7 support from certified technicians\n- Support for over 700 manufacturer technologies\n- Fixed price subscription regardless of technology deployed\n- Automatic support for in-room technology changes\n- Service portability to new rooms/room locations\n- Flexible subscription options for remote or on-site support\n- Room subscriptions of 25, 100, and 250 rooms are available\n- 1 and 3-year term options\n\n[Explore](https://avispl.com/services/enterprise-maintenance/)\n\n“AVI-SPL is our preferred AV vendor for all our audio visual needs.\nAVI-SPL has helped us convert all conference rooms larger than 10 people to Teams. These rooms are now the most used conference rooms on campus.”\n\nVerified User, Manager in Information Technology\n\nConstruction Company, 10,001+ employees\n\n11\n\nOur Other services\n\n### Keepingyourteamand  yourbusinessconnected\n\n[Contact](https://avispl.com/services/support-and-maintenance/#contact)\n\n[![A woman at a desk joins a video call on a laptop with four smiling people, holding a pen and notebook by charts and papers.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Voice-cloud-calling-Img-v2-1024x683.jpg)\\\\\n\\\\\n**Collaboration as a Service**](https://avispl.com/services/collaboration-as-a-service/) [![A technician in a black shirt examines cables by server racks in a tech-filled room with a tiled ceiling, creating an industrial vibe.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Support-and-Maintenance-1024x683.jpg)\\\\\n\\\\\n**Global Deployment**](https://avispl.com/services/global-deployment/) [![Lecture hall with rows of chairs, tables facing screens showing AVI-SPL logo; overhead lights, exit signs visible.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Rose-State-Colleges-Tanenbaum-Aerospace-and-Cybersecurity-Center-tiered-lecture-hall-with-Epson-projectors-on-1024x594.jpg)\\\\\n\\\\\n**Professional Services**](https://avispl.com/services/professional-services/) [![Recycle Responsibly. Boost Sustainability](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Recycle-Responsibly.-Boost-Sustainability-c.png)\\\\\n\\\\\n**Electronics recycling**](https://avispl.com/services/electronics-recycling/)\n\n14\n\n### Case Studies\n\nSee how we elevate events and environments through tailored audio-visual solutions.\n\n[View All](https://avispl.com/resources/case-studies/)\n\n[![Conference room: long table, white chairs, screens with butterfly wings. Laptop mirrors display. Well-lit, wooden ceiling.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/LG_Display_Photography_NJ_2023-21-scaled-1-scaled.jpg)\\\\\n\\\\\nCase Study\\\\\n\\\\\n**LG optimizes regional HQ work experience with digital displays and AVI-SPL support** View more](https://avispl.com/resources/case-studies/lg-optimizes-regional-hq-with-digital-displays-and-avi-spl-support/) [![Display image: person in blue jacket/jeans on forest path by wooden fence; autumn foliage. Indoor setting: green walls, fluorescent lights.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/C0006T01.jpg)\\\\\n\\\\\nCase Study\\\\\n\\\\\n**Nanolumens and Chief help AVI-SPL Dallas add centerpiece display to its workplace of the future** View more](https://avispl.com/resources/case-studies/nanolumens-and-chief-help-avi-spl-add-centerpiece-digital-display/) [![Modern building with flags: American, blue state, and blue with white text; large windows, curved facade, stairs, bench visible.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/20240326_140140626_iOS-scaled-1-scaled.jpg)\\\\\n\\\\\nCase Study\\\\\n\\\\\n**Rose State College** View more](https://avispl.com/resources/case-studies/rose-state-college/)\n\n13\n\n### Partners\n\nWe partner with leading collaboration providers.\n\n[![cisco logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/cisco-seeklogo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/cisco/)[![crestron logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Creston-Logo-2.svg)](https://avispl.com/crestron/)[![Google logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/google-Logo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/google/)[![HP Poly logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/hp-poly-large.svg)](https://avispl.com/hp-poly/)[![Logitech Logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/logitech-Logo-2.svg)](https://avispl.com/logitech/)[![Microsoft logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/microsoft-Logo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/microsoft/)[![Neat logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Neat-logo.svg)](https://avispl.com/neat/)[![Q-SYS logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/q-sys.svg)](https://avispl.com/q-sys/)[![Sennheiser logo: stylized S icon on the left, followed by bold SENNHEISER in capitals. Simple black and white design.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Sennheiser-Logo.png)](https://avispl.com/sennheiser/)[![zoom-logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/zoom-logo.svg)](https://avispl.com/zoom/)\n\n[![cisco logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/cisco-seeklogo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/cisco/)[![crestron logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Creston-Logo-2.svg)](https://avispl.com/crestron/)[![Google logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/google-Logo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/google/)[![HP Poly logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/hp-poly-large.svg)](https://avispl.com/hp-poly/)[![Logitech Logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/logitech-Logo-2.svg)](https://avispl.com/logitech/)[![Microsoft logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/microsoft-Logo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/microsoft/)[![Neat logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Neat-logo.svg)](https://avispl.com/neat/)[![Q-SYS logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/q-sys.svg)](https://avispl.com/q-sys/)[![Sennheiser logo: stylized S icon on the left, followed by bold SENNHEISER in capitals. Simple black and white design.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Sennheiser-Logo.png)](https://avispl.com/sennheiser/)[![zoom-logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/zoom-logo.svg)](https://avispl.com/zoom/)",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en-GB\" dir=\"ltr\">\n\n<body class=\"wp-singular page-template-default page page-id-3833 page-child parent-pageid-717 wp-custom-logo wp-theme-avi-spl\" style=\"\">\n<!-- Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->\n\n<!-- End Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->\n\n<div class=\"skip-link\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n    \t<a class=\"skip-link__btn\" href=\"https://avispl.com/services/support-and-maintenance/#main-content\" aria-label=\"Skip to main content\">Skip to main content</a>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n\n\t<main id=\"main\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<section class=\"hero page-block hero--x-small\">\n    \n                        <div class=\"hero__content\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 1; transform: translate(0px, 0%);\">\n                <div class=\"container\">\n                                                               <h1 data-splitting=\"words\" class=\"words splitting\" style=\"--word-total: 3; opacity: 1;\"><span class=\"word\" data-word=\"Support\" style=\"--word-index: 0; clip-path: polygon(0% 0%, 65.7428% 0%, 65.7428% 65.7428%, 0% 65.7428%);\"><span style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);\">Support</span></span><span class=\"whitespace\"> </span><span class=\"word\" data-word=\"&amp;\" style=\"--word-index: 1; clip-path: polygon(0% 0%, 57.4627% 0%, 57.4627% 57.4627%, 0% 57.4627%);\"><span style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);\">&amp;</span></span> <br><span class=\"word\" data-word=\"Maintenance\" style=\"--word-index: 2; clip-path: polygon(0% 0%, 47.6538% 0%, 47.6538% 47.6538%, 0% 47.6538%);\"><span style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);\">Maintenance</span></span></h1>\n                    \n                                            <div class=\"hero__content__text\"><p>AV/UC technology support options, including 24/7 help desk and field